Research is complete for all five questions. I found one important nuance in question 3: the current deletion route explicitly deletes owned items before deleting the user, and the existing deletion tests do not create/assert an owned item, so no current test actually detects loss of the database-level FK cascade. I’ll state that precisely rather than invent a test guarantee.
